# Renders docs/media/live-case-swe.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/live-case-swe.tape
Output docs/media/live-case-swe.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# LIVE CASE: SWE agent fixes a real open GitHub issue (themis#38)"
Enter
Type "uv run python -m examples.live_case_swe.run 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 120s
